Preserve ALVA’s existing combat behavior, input buffering, attack ownership, and contextual action restrictions unless an input-layer change is strictly necessary to meet this task.

Do not change attack damage, launch properties, movement balance, cooldowns, fighter abilities, or other unrelated game mechanics.

